@startuml
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title B — Durable timer and SMS failover
autonumber
participant "Temporal Service" as Temporal
participant "Workflow / Activities" as Worker
participant "Push / App" as Push
participant SMS
participant "Callback Ingress" as Ingress
Worker -> Temporal: Persist push activity and ACK deadline
Worker -> Push: Send with stable key
Push --> Worker: Response lost
Worker -> Temporal: Activity result = UNKNOWN
... worker restarts; history replays ...
Temporal -> Worker: Durable t=3 timer fired
Worker -> Push: Reconciliation activity: status lookup
Push --> Worker: Still UNKNOWN
Worker -> Temporal: Schedule SMS activity (within total deadline)
Temporal -> Worker: SMS activity task
Worker -> SMS: Send with stable SMS attempt key
SMS -> Ingress: Signed positive DLR
Ingress -> Ingress: Persist callback inbox before relay
Ingress -> Temporal: Signal(DLR, unique callback_id)
Temporal -> Worker: ACK event
Worker -> Temporal: DELIVERED; cancel unstarted email activity
Worker -> Temporal: Persist result/projection; close workflow
Push -> Ingress: Late device ACK
Ingress -> Ingress: Closed workflow: retain inbox evidence for audit
note over Temporal,Ingress
Closed-workflow signals remain in durable inbox.
Reconciler adds late evidence to audit.
Already sent SMS cannot be unsent by workflow cancel.
end note
note over Temporal,Worker
ESCALATED workflows stay open up to t=24h
for late ACKs; no new automatic sends after t=60s.
end note
@enduml
